              <p>The most popular style in Media, PA and nationally. Clean, recessed-panel design works with both traditional and contemporary kitchens. Shaker doors add $15–$50 per door over basic flat-panel pricing.</p>

              <h3>Flat Panel (Modern)</h3>
              <p>Popular in modern and minimalist designs. Often less expensive to manufacture; the default for European-style frameless cabinets.</p>

              <h3>Raised Panel</h3>
              <p>Traditional, formal appearance common in older Delaware County homes. Costs $20–$75 more per door than flat panels due to complex milling.</p>

              <h3>Glass-Front Cabinets</h3>
              <p>Add visual interest and a high-end appearance. Glass inserts cost $50–$200+ per door, plus interior lighting costs if desired.</p>
